The two prompt-specification documents shipped in data/rules/
(official_t2i.md and official_edit.md) are reproductions of the
official Qwen-Image prompt guidelines and remain the property of
their original authors. They are included so that the built-in
prompt optimizer can use them as a system prompt.
They are never modified by this project, and they are always sent
to the model byte-for-byte as-is.

A third file in the same directory, extra_transparent_subject.md,
is NOT an official document. It is written by this project, covers
the two areas the official specifications do not address
(transparent-image sentence patterns and subject extraction), and
is sent as a separate system message only when the user explicitly
enables it. It is licensed under the same Apache-2.0 terms as the
rest of this project.

